5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's make sure we pick a way that doesn't make us all freeze in winter! I want to see the sunlight and heating need by room and winter habits at a house paying ahead.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree we need a rational basis. I'll look into the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms to see the costs.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know if the paperwork is a nightmare! I'll check the trial run of a reconciliation template and the monthly settle observed at another house.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's time to see if some of us are actually subsidizing others. I'll examine the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the payment log for the last twelve months.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'm worried about the atmosphere here. I'll look at the payment log for the last twelve months and the kitchen notice about the cooler.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
