55,3,1,talk,Mio,,I'm sticking with Option A! It's the only one that ensures we actually stay warm without feeling guilty.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option B is too expensive. Option A still has a year-end reconciliation which could be messy. Option C is the most stable for monthly budgeting.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, I agree. Option C is the easiest. No complex templates, no year-end surprises, just divide by five.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option C is the most rational choice given the cost of meters. It stops the ""who is carrying who"" argument by making it a collective responsibility.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Rin and Shunichi. Option C is the cleanest break from our current habits of arguing over every single yen.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,But won't people still complain in Option C if they use very little power?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Possibly, but it's a known rule. The volatility of the bills is the real problem, and Option C distributes that risk equally.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Rin,,Exactly! It's just one division sum per month. That's way better than the forty-minute logging I read about.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"The ""fairness"" of meters isn't worth the 34,000 yen per room. Option C is the only practical way to move forward quickly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"If we all agree to Option C now, we can stop the reminders from feeling like accusations.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I still prefer A, but if everyone else hates the math, I guess C is okay. I just don't want to go back to wearing a coat!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,Option C is the most cautious approach. It requires no investment and minimal administration.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm definitely voting for C. My evenings are too precious for spreadsheets!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll vote for C. It's the most efficient solution to the current social friction.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm voting for C as well. Let's just make it simple and move on.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Mio,,"Okay, if you're all so sure, I'll go with the majority. Let's try C.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Option C it is.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! Simple is best!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,A sensible conclusion.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Misaki,,Thank you everyone for discussing this calmly.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
